# Design Review Gate

## Scope and Coverage
- [ ] Boundary Map present (Mermaid).
- [ ] File Structure Plan fully populated and consistent with Boundary Map.
- [ ] Every component has Intent, Requirements, Responsibilities, Dependencies, Contract.
- [ ] System Flows cover golden path AND top error cases.
- [ ] Errors, retry, timeout, idempotency addressed.
- [ ] Observability included.
- [ ] Rollout/rollback plan when needed.

## Quality Criteria
- [ ] Architecture consistent with tech.md and structure.md.
- [ ] Trade-offs and rejected alternatives documented.

## Mechanical Checks
- [ ] Every requirement ID in requirements.md appears in the Requirements Traceability table.
- [ ] Every component referenced in Boundary Map has a Components and Interfaces entry.
- [ ] design.md is under 1,000 lines.
